---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy | Rithvik Gurajala"
	description="How this portfolio uses visitor analytics"
>
	<main id="main-content" class="mx-auto min-h-screen max-w-2xl px-6 py-20">
		<a href="/" class="text-accent text-sm hover:underline"
			>Back to portfolio</a
		>
		<h1 class="mt-10 text-4xl font-semibold">Privacy</h1>
		<p class="mt-7">
			This portfolio records visits so I can understand how people find
			and use it. A visit record includes the time, your public IP
			address, approximate city, region and country inferred from that
			address, the page visited, your browser and device type, and the
			referring website if one is provided, and how long the site is open
			in your visible browser tab.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5">
			The site does not ask for your precise location. It does not store
			your full browsing history or use advertising trackers. Visit
			records are visible only in my password protected admin console and
			are removed after 30 days when the next visit or admin view runs.
		</p>
		<p class="mt-5">
			Questions about this data? Contact me at <a
				class="text-accent underline"
				href="mailto:rithvikgurajala@gmail.com"
				>rithvikgurajala@gmail.com</a
			>.
		</p>
	</main>
</Layout>
